senses.gloss:
मणिव, अस्, आ, अम्, in अ-मणिव, (perhaps)
‘having no jewels’ (opposed to सु-मणि, q. v.);
(अस्), m., N. of a serpent-demon.

माण्टि माण्टि, इस्, m., Ved., N. of a teacher;
(अयस्), m. pl., N. of his descendants; [cf. मण्टि,
मेण्ठ.]

माणक, अस्, m. a small shrub, Arum Indicum;
the bulbous root of the Arum Indicum; [cf. मा-
नक.]

माण्डलिक माण्डलिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. मण्-
डल), relating to a province, ruling a province;
(अस्), m. the governor of a province.
